  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><b>The Mission:</b><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><b>Elements of Life (EOL)</b><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>was built to elevate the standard. We refuse to use cheap fillers, gelatin (pork/beef by-products), or synthetic flow agents like Magnesium Stearate. We use<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><b>Organic Pullulan</b><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>and<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><b>NuFlow Rice Hulls</b>because we believe in purity and structural integrity. We don't cut corners on our product, and we don't cut corners on our partners.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><b>The Program: Industry-Leading Compensation</b><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>Most brands treat creators like cheap labor. We treat you like a partner. We’ve stripped away the \"middleman fees\" of the big marketplaces to funnel that revenue directly into your pocket.</p><ul style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><li><p><b>20% Commission:</b><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>We pay double what most supplement brands offer and<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><b>5x what Amazon pays</b>. You drive the traffic; you keep the lion's share of the acquisition cost.</p></li><li><p><b>Lifetime Customer Value:</b><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>Our products actually work, which means people come back. You aren't just selling a bottle once; you’re building a recurring revenue stream with a product that has high retention.</p></li><li><p><b>Direct-to-Creator Structure:</b><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>No \"waiting for approval\" or getting lost in a massive affiliate network. You work directly with us on our dedicated Shopify node, giving you real-time tracking and transparency.</p></li><li><p><b>Clean-Label Authority:</b><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>Your audience trusts you. Don't burn that trust on generic junk. Partner with the only brand using<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><b>Ascorbyl Palmitate (Vitamin C)</b><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>instead of industrial lubricants. Sell the best, and the sales come easy.</p></li></ul><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><b>Who We Want:</b><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>We are looking for creators who value<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><b>purity, performance, and profit</b>. If you want to build a sustainable, high-income asset alongside a brand that refuses to compromise—you belong with Elements of Life.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><b>Apply Now.</b><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><i>Elevate Your Health. Elevate Your Income.</i></p></div></div>",
